	"version": 1,
	"_about": "Skinned knives (polish1 D5b, DECISIONS_SKINS + diary/DESIGN_KNIVES.md, the director's draft to edit). A skinned knife = its own item {finish, type, pattern, wear, strength, kills}: finish = an id below (look + power), type = a knife type of data/knives.json, pattern 0-999 decides how the family's pattern lands (and its chase names), wear 0-1, strength = the power's roll (0.9-1.1). families: the look (kind = the shader's pattern) and its chase names by pattern (`chase`: [name, share of patterns], first match wins; phases = names for the rest by pattern). tiers: odds of a drop's tier. levels: kills needed from level n to n+1 = base + step * n, up to max; power strength from power_min to 1 and knife damage from 1 to damage_max across the levels. drops: chance of a knife from each crate (it takes the gun's place). powers: name + text; {n} = the number at full strength (level 30, strength 1), shown scaled by the knife's level and roll. The powers' effects are built in a later step (D5b part 2). powers.<id>.p: the power's numbers (n = the main number at full strength, scaled by level and roll; cooldowns, radii, seconds as they are). drops.boss: each player's chance of a knife when a boss dies (the host rolls it).",
